# Six abilities on six cooldowns, which is the whole of the player's interface.
#
# There are no cards in Emberline and no energy: an ability's only price is the seconds it makes
# you wait, so the game is deciding what to spend the next second of attention on. The cooldowns
# are 1s, 3s, 5s, 5s, 6s and 6s -- two to each of the three keepers, and all six ready when the
# hold starts. The one-second bolt is always a second away; the longer ones are the ones worth
# holding, because spending one now is deciding not to have it for the next three to six seconds.

# The Stoker's workhorse. One second, reaches the whole board, small.
ability "Ember Bolt"
  cooldown 1s
  target enemy
  range 5
  effect:
    deal 5 to target

# The Stoker's answer to a lane that has closed: it only reaches two ranks, so it is a reward for
# letting something get close. `within(target, 1)` is the square around where it lands.
ability "Backdraft"
  cooldown 6s
  target enemy
  range 2
  effect:
    deal 7 to enemies in within(target, 1)
    apply Scorched 2 for 3s to enemies in within(target, 1)

# The Warden's shield, on everyone, for three seconds out of every six. Holding it for the moment
# a Breaker lands is the difference between a hold and a rout.
ability "Bulwark"
  cooldown 6s
  effect:
    apply Braced 1 for 3s to party

# The Warden pushes a hollow back a rank and leaves it reeling for two seconds, so a lane about to
# break gets four seconds back. Only reaches what is nearly on top of the line.
ability "Haul"
  cooldown 3s
  target enemy
  range 2
  effect:
    if target.rank < 3:
      target.rank +1
    apply Reeling 1 for 2s to target

# The Lantern's flare: the light lands now and the fire lands two seconds later, on whatever is
# still standing there. `in 2s:` is the one thing a turn game cannot spell at all.
ability "Signal Flare"
  cooldown 5s
  target enemy
  range 5
  effect:
    apply Lit 1 for 4s to target
    in 2s:
      deal 9 to target

# The Lantern's mend. It cannot bring anyone back, only keep them up.
ability "Mend"
  cooldown 5s
  target ally
  effect:
    heal 10 to target
